Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FoggyRoadFallingObject" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :hasEvidence :fallingObjectIndicator1 ;
    :hasObstacle :roadObject1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :foggyCondition1 ;
    :hasRisk :collisionRisk1, :occlusionRisk1 .

:fallingObjectIndicator1 a :FallingObjectIndicator ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :collisionRisk1 .

:roadObject1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Falling object (potentially debris) on road" .

:foggyCondition1 a :FoggyCondition .

:collisionRisk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Risk of collision with falling object on road" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :severityScore1 .

:occlusionRisk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Risk of occlusion due to fog reducing visibility" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :severityScore2 .

:severityScore1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.9"^^xsd:float .

:severityScore2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.8"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

**Risk 1:**
Description: Risk of collision with falling object on road
Severity Score: 0.9

**Risk 2:**
Description: Risk of occlusion due to fog reducing visibility
Severity Score: 0.8